{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/096ee95d89755c35e880c254a57e998d.poster.avif?t=1759957476\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/096ee95d89755c35e880c254a57e998d.webm?t=1759957476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/096ee95d89755c35e880c254a57e998d.mp4?t=1759957476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Hextalia is a strategic tower defense set in a magical tabletop world, blending tactical path shaping with a variety of deep systems. Forge runes to empower your towers and adapt your board for upcoming challenges and follow the relic's rules to unleash an even stronger power on your board!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget just placing towers, You can build walls to control the enemy's path, turning the battlefield into your personal puzzle. Get creative and manipulate your enemies in clever ways!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless ways to craft and strategize, no two boards will ever play the same. Gems. Runes. Relics. Towers. Walls. Piece them together to forge powerful synergies experiment, adapt to shifting challenges, and break the meta in every game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board strikes back. Enemies also evolve as you grow stronger, <strong>with hard resistances that nullify damage from specific tower types</strong>. Shape new paths, adapt your loadout, and turn their strengths against them or watch your defenses crumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR FLOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle into a living board game. Release shackled crystals and expand your collection, discover Gems and master Relics that change how every turn plays. Combine items, choose and upgrade towers, sculpt paths with walls and save Hextalia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734940?t=1759957476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/20dfdac21a81de93a875159f4ae6ede8550373da/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759957476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/3c4b0c69af1db2e81c92d46589fd17f9b8082c17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759957476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/3c4b0c69af1db2e81c92d46589fd17f9b8082c17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759957476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/096ee95d89755c35e880c254a57e998d.poster.avif?t=1759957476\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/096ee95d89755c35e880c254a57e998d.webm?t=1759957476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source s